I'm not proposing adding more obscure physics jokes, just making things
a little more varied, by allowing Q to change either your position or
speed, both while alive or dead.  To me, Q are fairly boring--if you've
got teleport control, you can safely melee them, and if you're not
intrinsicly fast, you can safely eat them (and be guaranteed to speed
up).  Expanding their abilities like I proposed makes fighting them up
close slightly dicier (since you may lose intrinsic speed), and eating
them more questionable (since you may get *bamf*ed across the dungeon).

